{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>This — go up by the Negev.</b> The staff he handed to them so that they would be delivered from their hand. It is written here עלו זה, and it is written there (Exodus 4:17) ואת המטה הזה." "<b>And there are those who say:</b> מסורת שם = 12 (י״ב); he handed it to them in the manner of what is written (Exodus 3:15) ״זה שמי לעולם,״ so that they would go in peace on the way and be delivered from the hand of the giants. Thus I saw in the Midrash."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:32:00.434520676Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}